-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksthrough\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Through</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F13.40.54ea79\">13.40.54ea79</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 01, 2024<br/>Summer Update 2024</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20240604125627&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_Floss_Elemental_975c6b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a candy floss elemental.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Come into my fluffy embrace!</li><li>Want fairy floss? I will feed you up.</li><li>Did you have to come here, little one? I just wanted to lay around and take it easy.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>This special kind of elemental is a towering monster, standing tall and proud over its surroundings. Its body is made entirely of thick clouds of candy floss, giving it a soft, fluffy appearance. A colourful mixture of sprinkles runs through its sugary limbs. This elemental is rather slow-moving, owing to its soft and fluffy body. Its movement leaves behind sugary, sticky residue that may slow and hinder opponents. It can also suffocate and gum up enemies with its sweet and sugary clouds. Candy floss elementals are rather slow-witted and unambitious, preferring to lay around and take it easy as opposed to actively attacking or seeking trouble. However, if someone invades their territory, they can still react aggressively. Unfortunately this happens quite often, as their clouds of candy floss are delicious to consume and lure unsuspecting foes.\nCandy floss elementals come into being through a process known as the \"candy floss catalysis\". This phenomenon occurs when intense concentrations of sugar and sugary substances are left to accumulate and crystallize into sticky, sugary masses, eventually forming into candy floss elementals. The precise causes of this phenomenon are still unknown, but it is believed to occur in regions with high sugar content and intense levels of warmth and heat.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-capti